    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "<b>For Sale by Private Treaty (In one lot) Albany House, 126 Rathgar Road, Dublin 6 on approx. 0.5 Acres, D06 AY95 Comprising 3 Separate Dwellings.</b>\r\n\r\nThe property briefly comprises a secluded and impressive detached 2 storey Victorian residence known as Albany House which contains 6 no. self-contained 2-bedroom apartments along with two 3 storey modern semi-detached 4-bedroom houses, constructed 30 years ago, together with frontage and store accessed from Vernon Grove to rear. \r\n\r\nThe property is well set back from Rathgar Road and the total accommodation extends to approximately 640.23 sq.m. / 6,891.4 sq.ft. A small single storey gate lodge adjoining the entrance and driveway does not form part of the sale. \r\n\r\nAlbany House has well-proportioned accommodation with high ceilings and period features. The property in sale offers excellent investment income generation potential, as well as excellent redevelopment potential (subject to planning permission). The property will appeal to a wide range of purchasers including developers, investors, builders, residential instituitions, charities and embassies for existing residential purposes and for its redevelopment potential (subject to planning permission). \r\n\r\nTitle:\r\nWe understand that the property is held under freehold title and is offered for sale with full vacant possession.\r\n\r\nTown Planning\r\nThe property is situated in an area Zoned Z2 Residential Neighbourhoods (Conservation Area) under the Dublin City Development Plan 2022 to 2028.\r\n\r\nZ2 – Permissible Uses include: Residential, Embassy Residential, Guesthouse, Bed and Breakfast, buildings for the health, safety and welfare of the public, Childcare, Home-based economic activity, Medical and Related Consultant.\r\n\r\nZ2 – Open for Consideration Uses include: Assisted living/retirement home, Build to Rent residential, Community facility, Creative and Artistic Enterprises and Uses, Cultural/Recreational Building and Uses,  Education, Embassy Office, Hotel, Office, Place of Public Worship, Primary Health Care Centre, Residential Institution, Student Accommodation and Veterinary Surgery."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation \r\nHouse 1 Albany House (No. 126) \r\n\r\nApartment 1 (2 Bed Ground Floor) 76.42 sq.m. / 822.6 sq.ft. BER - E1 \r\nApartment 2 (2 Bed Ground Floor) 55.85 sq.m. / 601.2 sq.ft. BER - E1 \r\nApartment 3 (2 Bed First Floor) 62.24 sq.m. / 669.9 sq.ft. BER - D1 \r\nApartment 4 (3 Bed First Floor) 65.08 sq.m. / 700.5 sq.m. BER - D2 \r\nApartment 5 (2 Bed Ground floor Coach House) 57.99 sq.m. / 624.2 sq.ft. BER - D2 \r\nApartment 6 61.21 sq.m. / 658.9 sq.ft. BER - D1  (2 Bed First Floor Coach House)\r\n\r\nHouse 2 House (No. 126A) \r\n3 storey 4 bedroom 2 reception with 2 bedrooms ensuite, family bathroom and guest WC,  , off street parking and rear garden 123.27 sq.m. / 1,326.9 sq.ft. BER - C2 \r\n\r\nHouse 3 House B (No. 126B) \r\n3 storey 4 bedroom 2 reception with 2 bedrooms ensuite, family bathroom and guest WC,  off street parking and rear garden 123.27 sq.m. / 1,326.9 sq.ft. BER - C2 \r\nStore fronting rear laneway 14.9 sq.m. / 160 sq.ft. \r\n\r\nTOTAL AREA APPROX 640.23 sq.m. / 6,891.4 sq.ft"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Total area approx. 640.23 sq.m. / 6,891.4 sq.ft.\r\nFreehold property with full vacant possession. \r\nMature private setting with good off-street parking. \r\nInvestment income potential from 6 self contained 2 bedroom apartments and 2 no. 4 bedroom houses.\r\nRedevelopment potential (subject to planning permission).\r\nStore to rear accessed from Vernon Grove. \r\nBER C2/E1.\r\nPOA"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: C2 - E1 BER No.118697648"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "The property is well situated in this desirable and sought-after Dublin 6 residential area close to the Rathgar Village end of the road and adjacent to all of the amenities of both Rathmines and Rathgar villages, yet within walking distance of Ranelagh, Terenure, and City Centre. There are regular bus routes on Rathgar Road and the location is within walking distance of Cowper Green Line Luas Stop. \r\n\r\nThe area has many cafés, bars, delis and boutique eateries and an excellent selection of shops, supermarkets, cinemas and sports facilities. There is a wide selection of schools, both primary and secondary to include Rathgar Junior School, Kildare Place NS, Rathgar NS, Zion School NS, The High School, Alexandra College, Gonzaga, St. Mary's, Sandford Park, Muckross, Stratford College. \r\n\r\nLocal parks nearby include Bushy Park, Palmerston Park, the Dodder Linear Park. Local sports clubs include Rathgar Tennis Club, Rathgar Hockey Club and Our Lady's Hockey Club. Rugby clubs in the area include St Mary's and Terenure College. Golf is available at Milltown, The Grange, and Castle Golf Clubs"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "Viewing is strictly by prior arranged appointment only."
      }
